  "description": "Hopping Out is a tile-based puzzle game where you hop 2 tiles at a time. Play as Frog and use your tongue to move boxes, press buttons to create lily pads, all to catch many flies!\n\nSolve 200 puzzle levels across 7 worlds to help Frog move out of the busy swamp and live a calm life in the city!\n\nFeatures:• Hop two tiles, or bump into solid walls to stop yourself mid-jump.\n\n• Play around with many elements such as deadly bees, bouncy mushrooms, or fly-luring skunks.\n\n• Test your puzzle-solving in difficult bonus levels.\n\n• Explore a level select map with integrated puzzles and split paths.\n\n• Collect and mix-and-match cosmetics in the wardrobe.",
